<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>PAT-HOT · T光学元件与成像</title><link>https://sun-zihang.github.io/pat-hot/#/all</link><description>光学元件与成像</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>Infrared polymer boasts high index and transparency</title><link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41566-026-02033-8</link><description>Nature Photonics, Published online: 30 October 2026; doi:10.1038/s41566-026-02033-8 A bifunctional cyano-substitution synthetic strategy yields an all-organic polymer with a record-breaking refractive index of 2.53 at 750 nm, combining high infrared transparency with mechanical flexibility and solution-processability.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">e36336871cdc</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>Nature Photonics</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>Single-photon avalanche diode arrays: An avalanche of photon data for sharper imaging</title><link>https://www.laserfocusworld.com/detectors-imaging/article/55413803/single-photon-avalanche-diode-arrays-an-avalanche-of-photon-data-for-sharper-imaging</link><description>While typically associated with LiDAR, single-photon avalanche diode (SPAD) arrays can also be used as cameras for general-purpose imaging and perception by using ambient visible light.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">415abce10c44</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>Laser Focus World</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>遭14家机构疯抢！交大系光学企业「霖鼎光学」完成C+轮融资</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-11/ART-250003-12005-30710901.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">56e79ea9193c</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>加码原子级超精密光学制造！霖鼎光学完成新一轮融资</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-11/ART-8100-2500-30710722.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">7ed2c226ad6e</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>年内至少八笔！这家光学企业为什么被客户追着加单？</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-11/ART-8100-2500-30711181.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">8195a47df3cd</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>扩瞳不是 “放大画面”, 是 “复制出瞳”—— 光波导 Eyebox 的底层逻辑</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-11/ART-250002-11000-30711162.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">6ac3c9c5baf5</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>TV 畸变与光学畸变: 到底怎么换算？</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-11/ART-250004-11000-30710978.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">644a7dd5977f</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>多光子显微镜成像技术之五十五 面向体积多光子成像的自局域超快笔形光束</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-11/ART-250007-11000-30710938.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">50a942bcdedf</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>Exosens Pushes the Boundaries of Imaging Across the Spectrum</title><link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=skpaD4nbcq8</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">3ba1407a6034</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>YouTube·Photonics Media</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>B 端选型必读: 光波导厂商名录与技术路线对照</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-11/ART-250002-8420-30710627.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">8f48379ed321</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>道明光学三季报：Q3净利同比降56.54%</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-11/ART-8100-2500-30710133.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">953b0e82639b</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>Chirality of 'trions' illuminates new paths for quantum optics</title><link>https://phys.org/news/2026-11-chirality-trions-illuminates-paths-quantum.html</link><description>Scientists from Tokyo Metropolitan University have discovered that charged states made of two electrons and a positively charged hole (or vice versa) on atomically thin rolls of carbon atoms have a structure-derived "handedness" in how they interact with light. While electron-hole pairs, or "excitons," were known to keep the chirality of the underlying nanotube, the team showed that adding a charge to create "trions" does not change this property.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">99c6b7c6099d</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>Phys.org 物理新闻</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>新思科技获准向是德科技出售光学解决方案部门</title><link>https://www.c114.com.cn/news/212/a1298390.html</link><description>新思科技（Synopsys）宣布已获得所有相关监管机构的最终批准，将正式推进此前已公布的业务剥离计划：将旗下光学解决方案部门（Optical Solutions Group）及 PowerArtist 业务出售给是德科技（Keysight）。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">5db61d7aaa75</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_IT资讯</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>评测｜从360°影像到3DGS，影石Insta360 X6正在改变全景相机</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-08/ART-250003-8330-30698565.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">b5d516e6c63d</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>Air holes turn silicon wafers into flat ultraviolet focusing mirrors for compact optics</title><link>https://phys.org/news/2026-11-air-holes-silicon-wafers-flat.html</link><description>Traditional lenses and mirrors focus light using curved surfaces. Metasurfaces can achieve similar functions with a flat layer of nanoscale structures that locally control the phase of light. Extending these flat optics into the ultraviolet could support compact systems for high-resolution imaging, spectroscopy, and sensing, but it introduces a fundamental materials problem: many of the materials used to make metasurfaces strongly absorb UV light.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">1725e8ad8e7c</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>Phys.org 物理新闻</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>前沿｜全波硫系模压红外镜头：重塑红外成像成本与性能核心力量</title><link>https://cioe.cn/news/2921_info.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">5137764e92d9</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>CIOE 中国光博会</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>媒体看光博 | 维科网光学：光学赛道有何变化？</title><link>https://cioe.cn/news/3033_info.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">7a8a6e3d7d9c</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>CIOE 中国光博会</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>Expanding our Partnership with Teledyne Photometrics Scientific Cameras | Edmund Optics</title><link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3qH7xDED-_M</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">a0a457ea02eb</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>YouTube·Edmund Optics</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>Teledyne Photometrics Iris Scientific Camera Now Available! #imaging  #microscopy #research</title><link>https://www.youtube.com/shorts/pkFjTuOZA0U</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">86100d4ff969</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:34 GMT</pubDate><source>YouTube·Edmund Optics</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>Teledyne Photometrics BSI Prime Express Scientific Camera #science #imaging #rese